DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       llllddbb--sseerrvveerr  provides the server counterpart of the LLVM debugger.  The
       server runs and monitors the debugged program, while  the  user  inter‐
       faces  with  it  via a client, either running locally or connecting re‐
       motely.

       All of the code in the LLDB project is available under the  Apache  2.0
       License with LLVM exceptions.

